<https://w3id.org/nrdp/kosv#AssociationCardinalityShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b11 .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/shapes/kosv> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.2" .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/kosv#changeType> .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b14 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?a ?f (SUM(?v) AS ?sum) WHERE {\n            $this kosv:shareOf ?a ; kosv:fromConcept ?f .\n            ?x kosv:shareOf ?a ; kosv:fromConcept ?f ; kosv:shareValue ?v .\n          } GROUP BY $this ?a ?f\n            HAVING (ABS(SUM(?v) - 1.0) > 0.0001)\n          " .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#targetConcept> .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/kosv#sh_prefixes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#declare> _:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b3 .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?ct ?ns ?nt WHERE {\n            $this kosv:changeType ?ct .\n            { SELECT $this (COUNT(DISTINCT ?s) AS ?ns) WHERE { $this xkos:sourceConcept ?s } GROUP BY $this }\n            { SELECT $this (COUNT(DISTINCT ?t) AS ?nt) WHERE { $this xkos:targetConcept ?t } GROUP BY $this }\n            FILTER (\n              ( ?ct IN (kosv:Identity, kosv:Rename, kosv:Relocation) && (?ns != 1 || ?nt != 1) ) ||\n              ( ?ct = kosv:Merge        && (?ns < 2  || ?nt != 1) ) ||\n              ( ?ct = kosv:Split        && (?ns != 1 || ?nt < 2) ) ||\n              ( ?ct = kosv:MergeResplit && (?ns < 2  || ?nt < 2) )\n            )\n          }" .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/kosv#AssociationEditionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ConceptAssociation> .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "K2: 원천 개념 없음(신설은 연관이 아니라 kosv:introducedIn 으로 기록)" .
