_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefix> "xkos" .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#disjoint> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/kosv#targetEdition> .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "K2: 변경 유형이 정확히 1개여야 함" .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b15 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?f ?t WHERE {\n            $this kosv:shareOf ?a ; kosv:fromConcept ?f ; kosv:toConcept ?t .\n            FILTER ( NOT EXISTS { ?a xkos:sourceConcept ?f } || NOT EXISTS { ?a xkos:targetConcept ?t } )\n          }" .
_:nb46259a6340943a2868dd37de995b665b4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "K1: 대응표의 이전 판이 정확히 1개여야 함" .
